  "description": "Ilgang Group, the number one business group that controls the Korean economy. However, the inside is steamed and stained with various kinds of corruption.\n\nThe chairman, who needed a solution to save the decaying Ilgang group, makes a secret proposal by calling the youngest member of the Ilgang family, Lee Seon-Ho, who was living quietly in the United States, to Korea…\n\n“Humans who treat their employees like dogs and pigs! Our ‘In-house grievance team’ will take care of your abuse!”\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
